---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="EPC (RdSAP) Assessments in Glasgow | Scottish Energy Services"
  description="Arrange an EPC (RdSAP) assessment in Glasgow for rental or residential properties. Request a quick online quote with Scottish Energy Services."
  canonicalPath="/epc-glasgow"
>
  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="container-pro max-w-4xl space-y-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">EPC (RdSAP) assessments in Glasgow</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-700">
        If you need an updated EPC for a Glasgow property, Scottish Energy Services provides RdSAP assessments with a simple
        online quote and booking process.
      </p>
      <div class="quote-card space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">What this service includes</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-slate-700 space-y-1">
          <li>RdSAP assessment for existing domestic properties.</li>
          <li>EPC rating and recommendations as part of the certificate output.</li>
          <li>Clear booking details for landlords, owners, and property managers.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-700">
        Ready to book? Use the <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/#quote">instant online quote form</a> to request your
        preferred date.
      </p>
      <p class="text-slate-700">
        You can also compare nearby coverage for <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/epc-edinburgh">EPC assessments in Edinburgh</a>,
        or return to the <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/">Scottish Energy Services homepage</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
